🤖 AI Resume Analyzer

An AI-powered Resume Analyzer that evaluates a resume against a job description and provides personalized career guidance.

The system analyzes the candidate's resume, identifies matching and missing skills, suggests suitable career roles, recommends projects to build, and provides actionable improvements to make the resume more effective and ATS-friendly.

✨ Features
📄 Resume Analysis – Upload your resume in PDF format.
🎯 Job Description Matching – Compare your resume with a specific job description.
📊 Resume Score – Get an overall resume score out of 100.
🤖 ATS Analysis – Evaluate how well the resume matches ATS requirements.
✅ Strong Skills – Identify the skills already present in the resume.
📚 Skills to Improve – Get recommendations on which skills should be improved.
❌ Missing Skills – Identify important skills required by the target job but missing from the resume.
💼 Career Recommendations – Suggest suitable job roles based on the candidate's profile.
🚀 Project Recommendations – Recommend projects that can strengthen the candidate's resume.
📝 Resume Improvement – Get suggestions for improving resume content and presentation.
🎯 Personalized Action Plan – Receive a step-by-step plan for improving your profile.
