🎯 Purpose

The goal of this project is to help students and job seekers understand how well their resume matches a specific job, identify their skill gaps, and receive personalized recommendations for improving their career profile.

Instead of providing only an ATS score, the analyzer provides actionable guidance on what to learn, what projects to build, and which roles to consider.

